; eval_arena - dynamic layer.
;
; The six skeletons smoke.eval expects, at the cells it has always found
; them at, so its before/after tables stay comparable with older runs.
monster skel_coward 12 1 south
monster skeleton 12 6 south
monster skel_archer 25 7 south
monster skel_warrior 23 9 south
monster skel_mage 24 10 south
monster skel_swarm 13 13 south
;
; The levers' corner (code-review C211, see eval_arena.map): the lever at 1,22
; is wired to nothing, the one at 2,22 reveals the secret niche at 3,22. After
; the monsters, so their record ids are what they always were.
button lever 1 22 south
button lever 2 22 south target=arena_secret
